# ts-proto codegen output — the generator is the source of truth, so its raw
# output is committed verbatim and must not be Prettier-reformatted (doing so
# fights `buf generate`, which re-emits double-quoted, un-prettied code). See
# packages/proto (format globs are narrowed to hand-written src/*.ts).
