# Generated task index — scripts/generate-task-index.mjs emits unpadded Markdown
# tables; Prettier pads table columns to align, which the generator doesn't
# replicate, so formatting this file fights `pnpm tasks:write` on every
# regeneration. docs/libraries/*-consumers.md and the marked sections in
# docs/README.md / packages/lib.*/README.md don't have this problem (no
# tables) and stay in scope for Prettier.
docs/tasks.md
